                <pb facs="0149" n="53" xml:id="pg53"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#small-caps">wants doctor’s address.</hi></head>
                <p rendition="#flush">To the <hi rendition="#small-caps">Editor of the
                    Herald</hi>:</p>
                <p>I see in to-day’s Herald a letter from Dr. Paul Edwards. Can you or any of your
                    readers give the doctor’s address in Paris, and mention whether he is seeing
                    patients here?</p>
                <closer><hi rendition="#small-caps">One of Your Daily Readers.</hi>
                    <lb/>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Paris</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-05-12"><hi rendition="#italic">May 12,
                        1900</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
